            "After 2 normal attacks, the gun turret charges up its next attack into a devastating heavy barrage that fires 6 consecutive rounds at the enemy.",
            "Each round deals damage equal to 50% of the gun turret's ATK, stuns the enemy for 0.5s, and knocks them back."
          ],
          "upgrades": [
